Solos & Unaligned
Solo and Unaligned are special roles that aren't part of the townsfolk or werewolves team. Solo roles are their own team and must be eliminated by both townsfolk and werewolf teams for them to be able to win. Unaligned players do not have a team. Some of them may be able to win the game without ending it, while others join one of the other teams during the game. They don't have to be killed by the other teams, instead they may lose the game while still alive, while one of the teams wins.
Team Icons
Each team has its own icon shown on the card.
